      "role": "user",
      "content": "the problem is there isn't really a \"quiet space\" left for me. everywhere feels like noise. when you say \"step off the board\"... it's like the only way to actually get that peace is to just not be in the game anymore. to just stop. it feels like the only way to actually rest.",
